Mark Healey wrote:
> I've burned through about 20 crystal ball charges (boy are they heavy) and
> haven't been able to get to the portal quickly enough.  How do find and
> get to it in time?
> 

Patience. Someone may have a better answer, but in my experience, 
there's not much of trick to it. It doesn't actively run from you or 
anything, so even if you just wander around blindly you could expect to 
find it eventually. The only "trick" I know is wearing the Amulet which 
will feel inceasingly hot as you get close, but I've never actually used 
that method. Also just in case you haven't figured this out the portal 
doesn't teleport, it drifts. So if it's not were you expected it may 
well still be close.

